  m_Name: NoteHouse2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - Dear Diary
  - Theres been hushed whispers around the town of things slowly going to shit.
  - I try not to listen but even i know this town is under hard times
  - The Farm hasnt been able to keep up with the demand of the town and things there
    have been rough.
  - I hate the people here and wish them nothing but pain i'll get out of here as
    soon as i have the chance.
